# ⚽ Football Game using Python & Pygame

A 2D football (soccer) game developed using **Python** and **Pygame**, featuring player movement, ball physics, AI-controlled opponents, goal detection, score tracking, and an engaging gameplay experience.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

This project is a simple football game built with Python and Pygame. The player controls a footballer while competing against AI-controlled opponents. The game includes realistic ball movement, collision detection, goal scoring, and score tracking.

This project demonstrates:

- Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
- Game Development with Pygame
- Collision Detection
- Ball Physics
- Artificial Intelligence (AI)
- Event Handling
- Real-Time Rendering

---

