## 🚀 Installation

### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/football-game.git
```

### 2. Navigate to the Project Folder

```bash
cd football-game
```

### 3. Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install pygame
```

### 4. Run the Game

```bash
python game.py
```

