## ⚙️ Game Mechanics

### Player Movement
Players can move around the field using keyboard controls. Movement is restricted within the boundaries of the football field.

### Ball Physics
The ball reacts to player interactions and moves based on velocity and collision calculations.

### AI Opponents
AI-controlled players automatically track and chase the ball, creating a competitive gameplay experience.

### Goal Detection
When the ball crosses the goal line:

1. A goal is detected.
2. The appropriate team's score increases.
3. The ball resets to the center.
4. The match continues.

